{"id": "62985", "title": "狼系__烈爱", "author": "林羚", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 11, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/62/62985.htm", "intro": "上天开了一个大笑话……从小……确是遇上生命中的贵人！\r\n他如狼般的爆发力，冷酷无情瑞利的双眼，高贵，霸道\r\n又有难以抗拒的俊美邪逸建美的体魄…… \r\n如狼般的眼盯上猎物锁定她！\r\n注定一生的命运在他的手中。\r\n(想看女主角筱爱的好友！丽莎与金媛媛请接著看狼__吻", "base": "files/article/html/62/62985", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "9335851.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "9335853.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "9335855.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "9335857.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-30", "file": "9335859.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-37", "file": "9335860.html", "available": false}, {"title": "番外1-5", "file": "9335864.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "9335866.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "9335869.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-18", "file": "9335871.html", "available": false}, {"title": "番外", "file": "9335873.html", "available": false}]}